# Force git (and GitHub) to diff JavaScript sources as text.
#
# riskapp/db/import.js carried two literal NUL bytes — a cache-key separator
# written as a raw byte rather than the \0 escape. Git's binary heuristic trips
# on a NUL anywhere in the blob, so the whole file rendered as "Binary files
# differ" and every change to it was invisible in review. The bytes are gone,
# but this keeps any recurrence reviewable rather than silently unreadable.
#
# `diff` only affects diff generation — it does not touch storage or line
# endings (which `text` would).
*.js  diff
*.jsx diff
